WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Good evening. This is the overnight weather briefing for the field offices.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Wind gusts to sixty knots are expected after midnight along the coastal counties.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.000
Shelter managers should secure outdoor equipment before the front arrives.
